{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Scout: I Won't Let You Level Up In My Monster Village, Our Strongest Warrior Will Use My Equipment To Beat You Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a goblin scout living in a goblin town. You might not be the strongest goblin in town, but you are the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, your town comes under attack by heroes that try to level up by killing your fellow goblins. The town's strongest fighter goes out to meet them in turn based Active Time Battle, but is too weak on his own to defeat even the weakest of heroes. You, as the fastest in town, must bring him the items and equipment he needs to fight off these XP grinding heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019490/extras/bf9f6642c80cadac72088ab37092284a.poster.avif?t=1756192549\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019490/extras/bf9f6642c80cadac72088ab37092284a.webm?t=1756192549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019490/extras/bf9f6642c80cadac72088ab37092284a.mp4?t=1756192549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Active Time Turn based combat <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019490/extras/a4cc987eca74d0f9763f8818a6c2fa17.poster.avif?t=1756192549\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019490/extras/a4cc987eca74d0f9763f8818a6c2fa17.webm?t=1756192549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"